# NAME: Anthropic / Claude (Loon)
# AUTHOR: z285chen
# REPO: https://github.com/z285chen/Quantumult-X-Rules
# CORE REVIEWED: 2026-10-22 | UPDATED: 2026-11-25 | CONVERTED: 2026-11-25
# FORMAT: Loon remote rule; this file carries no policy name.
# POLICY: map it in [Remote Rule] with policy=Anthropic (or your own policy).
# ACTIVE RULES: 23
# Source: Anthropic.list (Quantumult X). Mapping, evidence and caveats: docs/Loon.md
# Other shared dependencies remain commented; the two Datadog intake hosts are enabled.

# Official product hosts: API, sign-in, downloads, previews, Artifacts and MCP Apps
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com

# Developer blog linked from claude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev

# Short links: community inventory; not in the official network requirements
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de

# Community domain inventory: enabled by request on 2026-11-18.
# Source and limits: docs/Anthropic.md; ownership and endpoint purposes not independently verified.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ant.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.team
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,antspace.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatbotclaude.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.new
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.site
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeacademy.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudepages.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudestudio.com

# Optional Claude Code operational telemetry and error reporting; enabled by request.
# SHARED Datadog hosts: other apps using these exact hosts also follow this policy.
DOMAIN,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com

# Official API inbound ranges; Loon names the IPv6 type IP-CIDR6.
# no-resolve is intentionally omitted to keep the source matching semantics:
# Loon only resolves a domain for IP rules when no domain rule matched.
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23
IP-CIDR,153.61.224.0/22
IP-CIDR6,2607:6bc0::/48

# Optional SHARED hosts: enabling these also routes other apps using them.
# Claude Code plugin metadata and native installers before version 2.1.116
# DOMAIN,storage.googleapis.com
# npm-based installs, plugin packages and npx-launched MCP servers
# DOMAIN,registry.npmjs.org
# GitHub-hosted plugins / marketplaces and release notes
# DOMAIN,github.com
# DOMAIN,raw.githubusercontent.com
# Homebrew update checks
# DOMAIN,formulae.brew.sh

# Optional SHARED Artifact fonts and JavaScript libraries
# DOMAIN,fonts.googleapis.com
# DOMAIN,fonts.gstatic.com
# DOMAIN,cdnjs.cloudflare.com
# DOMAIN,cdn.jsdelivr.net
# DOMAIN,cdn.tailwindcss.com
# DOMAIN,code.jquery.com
# DOMAIN,unpkg.com

# Optional ecosystem destinations
# MCP specification website; enable if you want its docs on this policy
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.io
